  - relates: https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=739866
  - relates: https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1328966
  - relates: https://bugzilla.redhat.com/show_bug.cgi?id=1328979
adjust+:
